<section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">Top 10 Sites for Free Stock Video Downloads</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-10">Last updated: 2026</p>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        Free stock video can improve presentations, YouTube videos, websites, and social media posts. Many sites offer high-quality footage under public domain or royalty-free licenses. This guide lists the top 10 sites for free stock video downloads.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Our top picks for free stock video</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Pexels, Pixabay, and Videvo offer modern, high-quality clips under permissive licenses. Coverr and Mixkit specialize in short cinematic footage. Life of Vids and Splitshire provide unique content. Videezy and StockSnap have large collections, and the Internet Archive offers historical public domain footage.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Step-by-step guide</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>{{ step }}</li><li>{{ step }}</li><li>{{ step }}</li><li>{{ step }}</li><li>{{ step }}</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Helpful tips</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>{{ tip }}</li><li>{{ tip }}</li><li>{{ tip }}</li><li>{{ tip }}</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Legal and safety reminder</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Only download content you created, own, or have explicit permission to use. Respect copyright, platform terms, and local laws. For more details, read our <a href="/content-policy" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Content Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        {% for q, a in faqs %}
        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">{{ q }}</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">{{ a }}</p>
        </details>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
